[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6549.83, "timestamp": "01:49:09", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6551.51, "timestamp": "01:49:11", "text": "膝を撃ってみたらどうですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6558.23, "timestamp": "01:49:18", "text": "ああ、確認しました。   お腹がすごく空いたよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6574.91, "timestamp": "01:49:34", "text": "10本の矢を手に入れます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6577.95, "timestamp": "01:49:37", "text": "よし、あと10本の矢だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6579.67, "timestamp": "01:49:39", "text": "これを最後まで言わせてください。 ああ、ここに隙間がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6591.35, "timestamp": "01:49:51", "text": "私は4つ手に入れた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6598.23, "timestamp": "01:49:58", "text": "二。"}]